contentText:
Cardi B is feeling pretty and petty after she reignited her feud with BIA on Thursday (Aug. 13). The Grammy-winning rapper went on the offensive against BIA in an explosive Spaces after the Massachusetts native appeared to double down on the claims she made in her &#8220;SUE MEEE?&#8221; Cardi diss track.

